  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGraph the linear inequality 2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 4 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21609\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/lt.gif\"\u003e \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21610\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/lt.gif\"\u003e 2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e + 3 on your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWrite as two inequalities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWrite the combined inequality as two separate inequalities.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21611\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/gt.gif\"\u003e 2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 4\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21612\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/lt.gif\"\u003e 2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e + 3\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21613\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21613\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and change the setting for Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21614\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21614\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e. To change the setting for Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e from the solid line to a \"greater than \" inequality, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21615\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qleft.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21615\u0026quot;,173)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21616\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qleft.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21616\u0026quot;,173)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21617\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21617\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21618\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21618\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The symbol changes to show a line with the half–plane above it shaded.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_12_90/f-90-13-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the right hand side of the first inequality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo enter the right hand side of the first inequality, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21619\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21619\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21620\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21620\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21621\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21622\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21622\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21623\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qminus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21623\u0026quot;,185)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21624\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21625\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21625\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_12_90/f-90-13-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eChange the setting for Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo change the setting for Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e from the solid line to a \"less than \" inequality, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21626\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qleft.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21626\u0026quot;,173)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21627\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qleft.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21627\u0026quot;,173)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21628\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21628\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21629\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21629\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21630\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21630\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The symbol changes to show a line with the half–plane below it shaded.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_12_90/f-90-13-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the right hand side of the second inequality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo enter the right hand side of the second inequality, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21631\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21631\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21632\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21632\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21633\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21634\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21634\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21635\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qplus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21635\u0026quot;,203)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21636\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-9 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_12_90/f-90-13-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question\"\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003eWhat would be an appropriate viewing window for this graph?\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4807\u0027,\u0027yes\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_0\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –10, Ymax \u003d 10, Yscl \u003d 1\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4808\u0027,\u0027no\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_1\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –100, Xmax \u003d 100, Xscl \u003d 10, Ymin \u003d –100, Ymax \u003d 100, Yscl \u003d 10\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4809\u0027,\u0027no\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_2\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d 0, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d 0, Ymax \u003d 10, Yscl \u003d 1\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe slope of the line is small.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21637\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qwindow.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21637\u0026quot;,255)\"\u003e and you can set Xmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –10, Ymax \u003d 10, Yscl \u003d 1.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-11 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_12_90/f-90-13-5.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21638\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21638\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e to graph the inequality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21639\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21639\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e to graph the inequality.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe intersection of the shaded areas is the solution of the given inequality.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-13 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_12_90/f-90-13-6.gif \"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
